    "detailed_description": "Nosos Is a multiplayer horror game.<br>The game take place in a house with four players and one monster (AI).<br>Players are named \u201cexorcists\u201c, they have a list of items to find in the house and to burn at the place of the ritual in order to beat the monster. But among the four players there is a renegade whose aim is to prevent the ritual process and kill all exorcists.<br>The renegade has habilities to partially control the monster and to slow down exorcists.<br>But if exorcists find out who the renegade is, they can get rid of him by tying him up and burning him in the place of the ritual.<br><br>Nosos was created to be played with 4 players, <br>however the game is playable with less than 4 players. <br>But for 2 players or less, some functionalities of the game have been removed.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Immersive Experience:</strong> With realistic graphics.<br></li><li><strong>Co-op:</strong> You can play with 4 friends of you in the game.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Nosos Is a multiplayer horror game.<br>The game take place in a house with four players and one monster (AI).<br>Players are named \u201cexorcists\u201c, they have a list of items to find in the house and to burn at the place of the ritual in order to beat the monster. But among the four players there is a renegade whose aim is to prevent the ritual process and kill all exorcists.<br>The renegade has habilities to partially control the monster and to slow down exorcists.<br>But if exorcists find out who the renegade is, they can get rid of him by tying him up and burning him in the place of the ritual.<br><br>Nosos was created to be played with 4 players, <br>however the game is playable with less than 4 players. <br>But for 2 players or less, some functionalities of the game have been removed.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Immersive Experience:</strong> With realistic graphics.<br></li><li><strong>Co-op:</strong> You can play with 4 friends of you in the game.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Nosos is a cooperative horror game from 1 to 4 players. Find all the demonic objects and complete a ritual without getting caught by the monster in the house.",
